from common import E
# Graphics / filter / painting / shading batch — 24 new cards. Numbers are authoring defaults.

E('LGT-15','大氣與體積','Komorebi / dappled canopy light',['Dappled canopy light','Forest floor godets','Leaf-gap sunlight','木漏れ日','樹隙光斑','木洩れ日','葉隙間の光'],'C',
('木漏れ日／樹隙光斑','樹冠下地面與角色身上，出現圓形或柔邊的暖色光斑；光斑由葉隙漏下，隨枝葉搖動而滑移、變形，並在樹蔭處一致變暗。','不是光罩投影（LGT-03，那是可用來仿造此畫面的方法）；也不是可見光柱（REN-27）；也不是單一物件的半影邊緣（REN-25）；也不是大尺度雲影（ENV-07）。本條命名可辨認的樹冠斑駁光本身。','森林步道、林間戰鬥、需要「陽光穿過葉隙」的戶外氣氛。','進入林間日照表現：樹冠下的地面、角色與附近道具出現圓潤暖色光斑，隨葉擺滑移變形，樹蔭處同步變暗；關閉後恢復均勻日照。'),
('Komorebi / dappled canopy light','Under a tree canopy, rounded warm light spots land on the ground and slide across characters and props as leaf gaps move. Spots breathe and reshape with foliage sway, and canopy shade darkens coherently.','Not a light cookie (LGT-03 — a method that can fake this picture). Not visible shafts in air (REN-27). Not a single object’s penumbra edge (REN-25). Not large slow cloud patches (ENV-07). This card names the recognizable canopy-dapple picture itself.','Forest paths, woodland combat, outdoor scenes that need sunlight through leaf gaps.','Enter a sunlit forest presentation → ground, character, and nearby props under canopy → rounded warm spots appear where leaf gaps aim, slide and reshape as leaves sway, and darken coherently in canopy shadow → restore even illumination when disabled.'),
('木漏れ日／葉隙間の光','樹冠の下で、丸く柔らかい暖色の光斑が地面に落ち、キャラや小物の上を滑る。葉の揺れで斑点が息をするように形を変え、樹陰はまとまって暗くなる。','ライトクッキー（LGT-03、この絵を安く真似る手段）ではない。空中の光筋（REN-27）でも、単体の半影縁（REN-25）でも、大きな雲影（ENV-07）でもない。木漏れ日という「絵」そのものを名指す。','森の道、林間の戦闘、葉隙から差す陽が欲しい屋外。','林間の日照演出に入ったら、樹冠下の地面・キャラ・小物に丸い暖色斑を出し、葉揺れで滑らせ形を変え、樹陰を一貫して暗くする。無効化で均一な日照に戻す。'),
'spot scale · sway amplitude · warmth tint · canopy shadow depth · scroll speed (authoring defaults)',
'Multiply a soft circular/spot noise cookie (or projected gobo) over direct sun on ground and characters; animate UV with foliage-sway phase. Keep ambient separate so shade still reads. Prefer world-locked UVs so spots do not swim with the camera.',
['LGT-03', 'REN-25', 'REN-27', 'ENV-07', 'ENV-08', 'REN-29'],['gx_komorebi', 'gx_capa_mist', 'lg_u_cookie'])

E('LGT-16','大氣與體積','Stained-glass colored light pool',['Stained-glass light pool','Colored window caustic','Cathedral colour spill','彩窗色光','彩色玻璃投影','ステンドグラスの投影','色つき窓光'],'C',
('彩窗色光池','彩色玻璃（或色窗）把分明的色塊投到地面、長椅與站在池中的人身上；色塊可隨太陽角度緩慢爬移。','不是彩繪玻璃格子風格（NPR-20，把畫面本身切成鉛框發光格）；也不是光罩方法本身（LGT-03）；也不是水底焦散網（ENV-14，通常單一陽光色）；也不是全畫面調色（REN-32）。','教堂、彩窗走廊、需要「色光落在人身上」的室內。','啟用彩窗光照：地板與池中角色收到與窗格對應的飽和色塊，並隨太陽角緩移；關閉後恢復白色日照。'),
('Stained-glass colored light pool','Colored glass (or a colored window) throws distinct hue patches onto the floor, pews, and anyone standing in the pool. Patches can creep as the sun angle changes.','Not stained-glass cell style (NPR-20), which breaks the *image* into leaded glowing cells. Not the cookie method (LGT-03). Not water caustics (ENV-14, usually one sunlight colour as bright nets). Not a global grade (REN-32).','Cathedrals, colored-window corridors, interiors that need colour spill on people.','Enable cathedral window lighting → floor and a character in the pool → saturated colour shapes that match the window’s panes land on surfaces and move slowly with sun angle → restore white sunlight when disabled.'),
('ステンドグラスの色光だまり','色ガラス（または色つき窓）が、床・長椅子・光だまりに立つ人へはっきりした色の斑を落とす。太陽角でゆっくり這うこともある。','ステンドグラス格子スタイル（NPR-20、画面自体を鉛枠の光るセルにする）ではない。クッキー手段（LGT-03）でも、水のコースティクス網（ENV-14）でも、全体グレーディング（REN-32）でもない。','教会、色窓の回廊、人に色光が落ちる室内。','色窓ライティングを有効にし、床と光だまり内のキャラに窓の区画と対応する彩度の高い色形を落とし、太陽角でゆっくり動かす。無効化で白い日照に戻す。'),
'pane colours · pool softness · sun-creep speed · intensity · which surfaces receive colour (authoring defaults)',
'Project a multi-colour cookie (or several tinted cookies) from the window light into light space; multiply into direct lighting on receivers. Animate the projection with a slow sun-angle offset. Do not recolour the whole frame.',
['LGT-03', 'ENV-14', 'LGT-15', 'NPR-20'],['gx_stained_pool', 'lg_u_cookie'])

E('LGT-17','大氣與體積','Backlit leaf translucency',['Backlit foliage','Leaf subsurface glow','Transmitted leaf light','逆光透葉','葉片透光','逆光の葉透け','木の葉の半透明'],'C',
('逆光透葉','太陽在葉叢後方時，葉片本身發出黃綠（或秋暖）透光，葉脈可辨；光在葉內，不是只描輪廓。','不是一般次表面散射（REN-19，常指皮膚）；也不是僅貼輪廓的邊緣光（REN-05）；也不是葉隙投到其他表面的斑點（LGT-15）。','逆光林道、樹葉特寫、需要「葉會透光」的植被。','把太陽放在枝葉後方：薄葉區呈暖綠透光並顯葉脈，不透明細枝保持較暗；光改到前方後恢復不透明前光葉。'),
('Backlit leaf translucency','When the sun sits behind foliage, leaves glow yellow-green (or autumn warm) and veins become readable. The glow is in the leaf, not a rim outline alone.','Not general SSS (REN-19, often skin). Not rim light hugging the silhouette (REN-05). Not spots cast by gaps onto other surfaces (LGT-15).','Backlit forest paths, foliage close-ups, vegetation that must transmit light.','Place the sun behind a leafy branch → the leaves themselves → transmitted warm-green glow with visible vein structure on thin regions; opaque twigs stay darker → restore front-lit opaque leaves when the light moves in front.'),
('逆光の葉透け','太陽が葉の後ろにあると、葉そのものが黄緑（または秋の暖色）に透け、葉脈が読める。輪郭だけのリムではない。','一般的な SSS（REN-19、しばしば肌）ではない。シルエットのリム（REN-05）でも、葉隙が他面に落とす斑（LGT-15）でもない。','逆光の林道、葉のクローズアップ、透ける植生。','太陽を枝葉の背後に置くと、薄い葉は暖緑に透け葉脈が見え、不透明な小枝は暗いまま。光が前に回ると通常の不透明な前光に戻す。'),
'transmission colour · thickness map · vein contrast · front vs back blend · twig opacity (authoring defaults)',
'Shade leaves with a thin-surface transmission term when N·L is negative (or L is behind the leaf): albedo * transmissionColour * thickness. Add a vein darkening texture. Keep woody twigs opaque.',
['REN-19', 'REN-05', 'LGT-15', 'ENV-08'],['gx_leaf_sss'],nosrc=True)

E('LGT-18','間接光與陰影','Character–environment lighting separation',['Split lighting rig','Character vs environment lights','Hero light separation','角色與場景分開打光','キャラと背景のライティング分離'],'C',
('角色與場景分開打光','角色由可讀、常較簡或較暖的主光打亮（為臉與服裝設計），場景則保留自己的光照；兩者可略不一致但仍顯得刻意。','不是物理 GI 把角色綁死在房間反彈色（REN-20）；也不是每材質指定影色（NPR-21）；也不是未受光角色貼在受光背景上（REN-02）——兩邊都有光，只是分開編排。','強對比／強染色場景中仍要讀得清臉的角色演出。','把角色放進強色或強對比環境：角色保持穩定可讀的主光／補光，房間光照獨立；角色移動時不被每道反彈色突然染色。可選 LINKED GI 對照。'),
('Character–environment lighting separation','The character is lit by a readable, often simpler or warmer key designed for face and costume, while the environment keeps its own lighting. The two can disagree slightly and still look intentional.','Not physical GI binding the character to room bounce (REN-20). Not per-material authored shadow colour (NPR-21). Not an unlit character (REN-02) pasted on a lit background — both sides are lit, with separate authorship.','Readable faces in strongly coloured or contrasty environments.','Place a character in a strongly coloured or contrasty environment → character vs surrounding surfaces → character keeps a stable, readable key/fill while the room lighting stays independent; moving the character does not suddenly dye them with every bounce colour → optional linked-GI compare lane.'),
('キャラと背景のライティング分離','キャラは顔と衣装向けの読みやすい（しばしば単純／暖色の）キーで照らされ、背景は独自の照明を保つ。少し食い違っても意図的に見える。','物理 GI で部屋の色に縛る（REN-20）ではない。材質ごとの指定影色（NPR-21）でも、アンリット貼り付け（REN-02）でもない。両方ライティングするが作者を分ける。','強い色やコントラストの環境でも顔が読める演出。','強い色の環境にキャラを置き、キャラは安定したキー／フィル、部屋は独立照明。移動で跳ね返り色に染められない。LINKED 対照レーン可。'),
'character key colour/intensity · env lights · link vs separate blend · fill ratio (authoring defaults)',
'Maintain a separate character light group (or light layers/channels) that ignores most env lights and GI. Composite character shading from the hero rig; optionally show a linked-GI compare. Keep both sides lit.',
['REN-20', 'REN-03', 'LGT-01', 'NPR-21'],['gx_split_light'],nosrc=True)

E('LGT-19','間接光與陰影','Hemisphere / sky–ground ambient',['Hemisphere lighting','Sky–ground ambient','SH ambient','Zenith–nadir tint','天空—地面半球環境光','半球ライティング','空と地面のアンビエント'],'S',
('天空—地面半球環境光','朝上的面偏天空色，朝下的面偏地面反彈色；補光是垂直色相漸層，不是單一灰環境光。','不是完整 GI／染色反彈（REN-20）；也不是全畫面調色（REN-32）；也不是高度霧（LGT-12）。','戶外角色、簡易環境光、需要「天光／地光」分離的 stylized 場景。','只用環境光（或弱主光＋環境光）照亮：物體頂面偏天空色、底面偏地面色，依 normal.y 平滑過渡；關閉後恢復平坦環境光。'),
('Hemisphere / sky–ground ambient','Upward-facing surfaces pick up sky colour; downward-facing surfaces pick up ground bounce colour. The fill has a vertical gradient of hue, not a single grey ambient.','Not full GI / colour bleeding (REN-20). Not a global grade (REN-32). Not height fog (LGT-12).','Outdoor characters, cheap ambient, stylized scenes that need sky vs ground fill.','Light a scene with only ambient (or a weak key plus ambient) → object tops vs undersides → tops lean sky-coloured, undersides lean ground-coloured, with a smooth term based on normal.y → restore a flat ambient on disable.'),
('半球ライティング／空と地面のアンビエント','上向き面は空色、下向き面は地面の跳ね返り色。フィルは縦の色勾配で、単一の灰色アンビエントではない。','完全な GI（REN-20）でも全体グレーディング（REN-32）でもハイトフォグ（LGT-12）でもない。','屋外キャラ、簡易環境光、天光／地光を分けたい様式。','アンビエントのみ（または弱いキー＋アンビエント）で、上面は空色・下面は地面色、normal.y で滑らかに。無効化で平坦アンビエントに戻す。'),
'sky colour · ground colour · normal.y remap · optional weak key (authoring defaults)',
'ambient = lerp(groundColour, skyColour, saturate(n.y*0.5+0.5)). Evaluate in the shading model as the ambient term. Optionally add a dim directional key.',
['REN-20', 'LGT-13', 'REN-32'],['gx_hemi', 'lg_u_probes'],nosrc=True)

E('ENV-21','水','Sun glitter / glittering water specular',['Sun glitter','Glittering highlights','Sparkling water specular','Sun path on water','水面金光','波光粼粼','太陽のきらめき','水面のきらきら','サングリッター'],'C',
('水面金光／太陽閃爍','波浪水面上有一片跳動的亮點，沿太陽反射路徑最密，隨波面翻轉乍現乍滅。','不是水面本身（ENV-12）；也不是水底／鄰牆的焦散網（ENV-14）；也不是單一材質高光（REN-10）；也不是熱浪扭曲（ENV-17）。','海邊、湖面日落、需要「波光粼粼」的遠景水。','望向日照水面：波面小面出現短暫閃光，沿太陽反射路徑聚集並隨波閃爍；太陽離開反射錐或水面靜如鏡時閃光減弱。'),
('Sun glitter / glittering water specular','A field of dancing bright sparkles on a wavy water surface, densest along the sun’s reflection path, appearing and vanishing as wave facets turn.','Not the water surface itself (ENV-12). Not focused bright nets on the floor or nearby walls under water (ENV-14). Not a single material highlight (REN-10). Not heat haze (ENV-17).','Seaside, lake sunsets, distant water that must glitter.','Look across sunlit water → water surface facets → many short-lived glints cluster toward the solar reflection and twinkle as waves move → glints fade if the sun leaves the reflecting cone or the water calms to glass.'),
('太陽のきらめき／サングリッター','波立つ水面に短い明るい輝きが踊り、太陽の反射経路に最も密集し、面が向くたびに現れ消える。','水面そのもの（ENV-12）でも、水底のコースティクス網（ENV-14）でも、単一ハイライト（REN-10）でも、陽炎（ENV-17）でもない。','海辺、湖の日没、きらめく遠景の水。','日照の水面を見る：波の小面が短命の輝きを出し、太陽反射路に集まり波で瞬く。太陽が反射錐から外れるか水面が鏡のように静まると弱まる。'),
'glint density · sun path width · lifetime · calm-water falloff · intensity (authoring defaults)',
'On the water surface shader, spawn thresholded specular glints where microfacet normals align with the half-vector toward the sun; densest near the solar glitter cone. Fade when roughness→0 (glass calm) or sun leaves the cone.',
['ENV-12', 'ENV-14', 'REN-10'],['gx_sunglitter', 'w_caustic'])

E('PP-14','風格濾鏡','Bleach bypass / Skip bleach',['Bleach bypass','Skip bleach','Silver retention','留銀效果','漂白旁路','銀残し','ブリーチバイパス'],'S',
('漂白旁路／留銀','畫面硬、顆粒感強：黑色更深、色彩減弱、高光對比強硬；仍保留一些顏色，不是純黑白轉換。藍青偏色可選，非必要。','不是一般調色（REN-32）；也不是單純去飽和（PP-06）；也不是只改色調曲線（REN-31）。本條命名可辨認的留銀組合。','戰爭、寫實槍戰、需要「粗粝電影感」的場面。','選用粗粝表現：場景影像（不含 HUD）加深黑色、降低飽和並硬化對比，仍留部分色彩；關閉後恢復乾淨畫面。'),
('Bleach bypass / Skip bleach','A hard, gritty image with heavy blacks, reduced colour, and forceful highlight contrast. Some colour remains — it is not a black-and-white convert. A blue/cyan cast is optional, not defining.','REN-32 is grading in general; PP-06 removes saturation; REN-31 shapes tonal response. This names a recognizable combination, not simply “less colour.”','War, grounded gunplay, scenes that need a gritty film look.','Select gritty presentation → scene image, excluding HUD → deepen blacks, reduce saturation and harden contrast while retaining some colour → restore the clean picture when disabled.'),
('銀残し／ブリーチバイパス','硬くざらついた絵。黒が重く、色は減り、ハイライトのコントラストが強い。完全な白黒ではなく色は残る。青みは任意で必須ではない。','一般グレーディング（REN-32）や単なる脱彩度（PP-06）、トーン曲線だけ（REN-31）ではない。銀残しの組み合わせを名指す。','戦争、写実ガンプレイ、ざらついた映画調。','ざらつき表現を選び、シーン（HUD 以外）の黒を深め彩度を下げコントラストを硬くし、色は残す。無効化で清い絵に戻す。'),
'saturation retention · black crush · contrast · optional cyan cast · HUD exclude (authoring defaults)',
'Fullscreen grade after tonemap: desaturate partially, lift contrast (S-curve), crush lows, optionally add a cool cast to mids. Keep UI/HUD on an ungraded layer.',
['REN-32', 'PP-06', 'REN-31', 'PP-02'],['gx_ricoh_bypass', 'gx_w_bleach'])

E('PP-15','風格濾鏡','Selective colour / Colour splash',['Selective colour','Colour splash','Colour isolation','Leave-one-colour','局部保色','選擇性留色','黑白留紅','パートカラー','部分カラー','色残し'],'S',
('局部保色／色彩隔離','近乎黑白的世界裡，只保留一個（或一類）鮮明彩色主體；該主體保留原色相、明暗與移動輪廓。','不是全畫面去飽和（PP-06）；也不是調查系統（NAV-08）；也不是為可讀性重上色的無障礙色（A11Y-06）。注意：與 Photoshop「Selective Color」通道混色工具同名但不是同一回事。','突出唯一重要物件、回憶中的紅衣、海報式留色。','進入局部保色：環境去色，指定主體保留原色、明暗與移動輪廓；離開後恢復全彩。'),
('Selective colour / Colour splash','An almost monochrome world containing one vividly coloured subject or colour family. The kept subject retains its original hue, shading, and moving silhouette.','PP-06 desaturates everything. NAV-08 is an investigation system with clue trails. A11Y-06 recolours important silhouettes for readability. Distinct from the Photoshop “Selective Color” CMYK mixing tool — same English name, different meaning.','Highlighting one important object, a red coat in memory, poster-style leave-one-colour.','Enter selective-colour presentation → environment and chosen subject → desaturate surroundings while preserving the subject’s original colour, shading and moving silhouette → return all colours on exit.'),
('パートカラー／色残し','ほぼモノクロの世界に、鮮やかな色の主体（または色族）だけが残る。残した主体は元の色相・陰影・動く輪郭を保つ。','全面脱彩度（PP-06）ではない。調査システム（NAV-08）でも、可読性のための再着色（A11Y-06）でもない。Photoshop の「Selective Color」（CMYK 混色）とは同名異物。','唯一の重要物、記憶の赤いコート、ポスター風の色残し。','パートカラーに入り、環境を脱色しつつ指定主体の色・陰影・輪郭を残す。終了で全色復帰。'),
'kept hue range or object mask · feather · desaturation amount · subject ID (authoring defaults)',
'Desaturate the frame, then restore colour where a subject mask or hue distance says keep. Prefer an object/ID mask for a moving coat so shading stays; hue-only keep is a cheaper alternate. Exclude HUD.',
['PP-06', 'NAV-08', 'A11Y-06', 'PIX-06'],['gx_selcolor', 'pp_w_gray'])

E('PP-16','鏡頭模擬','Prism filter / Split-prism image',['Prism filter','Split-prism','Kaleidoscopic lens','Glass shard repeat','棱鏡濾鏡','分像效果','萬花筒鏡頭','プリズムフィルター','分身効果','万華鏡フィルター'],'C',
('棱鏡濾鏡／分像','畫面局部重複、翻轉或碎成玻璃般的複本，主體仍可辨認。','不是一般畫面扭曲（PP-09）；也不是色差邊緣（REN-36）；也不是鏡頭鬼影光斑（REN-35）。本條複製可辨認的場景內容，不是光斑或 RGB 輪廓。與分焦濾鏡（REN-34）不同——那是同時清晰的遠近焦點。','幻覺、超現實過場、音樂視覺、角色「碎裂感知」。','啟動碎裂感知：在畫面邊緣引入兩至三個傾斜／反射複本，並與當前影像連動；退出時收回複本。'),
('Prism filter / Split-prism image','Part of the picture repeats, flips, or fractures into glass-like copies while the main subject remains readable.','Not warp/distortion (PP-09). Not chromatic fringing (REN-36). Not light ghosts/flares (REN-35). This duplicates recognizable scene content, not just light spots or RGB outlines. Keep separate from split diopters (REN-34), which concern simultaneous focus.','Hallucination, surreal cutaways, music visuals, fractured perception.','Activate fractured perception → selected frame edges → introduce two or three angled/reflected copies that move coherently with the current image → retract those copies on exit.'),
('プリズムフィルター／分像','画面の一部が繰り返し・反転・ガラス片のように割れ、主体は読めるまま。','歪み（PP-09）でも色収差縁（REN-36）でもフレア（REN-35）でもない。光点ではなくシーン内容の複写。スプリットディオプター（REN-34）の同時合焦とも別。','幻覚、超現実の挿入、ミュージックビジュアル、知覚の割れ。','分断知覚を有効にし、縁に 2〜3 の斜め／反射コピーを出し、現在の絵と連動させる。終了で引っ込める。'),
'shard count · angle · offset · opacity · edge mask (authoring defaults)',
'Composite 2–3 masked, transformed copies of the colour buffer (rotate/flip/offset) along frame edges. Drive transforms from the live frame so motion matches. Keep centre subject mostly unobstructed.',
['PP-09', 'REN-36', 'REN-35', 'REN-34'],['gx_prism', 'pp_g_screen'])

E('PP-17','風格濾鏡','Cross-processing / X-pro',['Cross-processing','X-pro','Cross-processed look','交叉沖洗','正片負沖','クロスプロセス','クロス現像'],'S',
('交叉沖洗／X-pro','強烈、化學上「不對」的色彩：陰影與高光被不同地推移（常見教學例：綠青陰影配黃高光）。結果多變；沒有單一正確的綠色交叉沖洗預設——卡片需說明這點。','REN-32 是調色總類；CIN-14 是回憶／閃回包裝。本條是具名攝影家族，不是泛用 LUT 或閃回套餐。','復古攝影、音樂錄影帶感、異常但刻意的色彩。','啟用交叉沖洗：場景引入明確例子（如綠青陰影與黃高光）、強對比與異常色彩關係；關閉後乾淨還原。'),
('Cross-processing / X-pro','Punchy, chemically “wrong” colour, with conspicuous casts and differently shifted shadows and highlights (a common teaching example is green-cyan shadows with yellow highlights). Results vary; there is no single universally correct green cross-process preset — say so on the card.','REN-32 is the umbrella grade. CIN-14 is memory/flashback. This is a named photographic family rather than a generic LUT or a flashback package.','Retro photography, music-video colour, deliberately wrong colour.','Enable cross-processed treatment → scene image → introduce an explicit example such as green-cyan shadows and yellow highlights, with strong contrast and unusual colour relationships → clean restoration on disable.'),
('クロスプロセス／クロス現像','化学的に「間違った」強い色。影とハイライトが別方向にずれ（教材例：緑青の影と黄色いハイライト）。結果は多様で、唯一正しい緑プリセットはない——カードで明示する。','REN-32 は総称。CIN-14 は回想パッケージ。名のある写真ファミリーであり汎用 LUT ではない。','レトロ写真、MV 的な色、意図的な色のずれ。','クロスプロセスを有効にし、緑青影＋黄ハイライトなどの例を入れ、強いコントラストと異質な色関係を出す。無効化で戻す。'),
'shadow tint · highlight tint · contrast · preset label (example, not universal) · HUD exclude (authoring defaults)',
'Split-tone after tonemap: push shadows toward green-cyan and highlights toward yellow (one authored example), raise contrast. Document that other chemical looks exist; expose a preset name rather than claiming one true curve.',
['REN-32', 'CIN-14', 'PP-14', 'PIX-09'],['gx_ricoh_bypass', 'gx_xpro'])

E('PP-18','風格濾鏡','Image-intensifier night vision / NVG look',['Night vision','NVG look','Image-intensifier','White-phosphor NV','微光夜視','綠色夜視','白磷夜視','暗視ゴーグル','微光暗視','ナイトビジョン'],'S',
('微光夜視／NVG','黑暗變成帶顆粒的綠色或白磷單色影像，燈火特別敏感並出現光暈／泛光。','REN-30 改曝光；PP-02 加顆粒；REN-32 改色——單獨都不是「微光增強儀器畫面」。與 NAV-08 不同，不必標線索或透視牆。綠色常見但非必須；白磷變體同卡（參數：phosphor palette）。','潛行、軍事、科幻護目鏡視角。','在暗室開啟夜視：以磷光單色呈現低光結構，含克制感光雜訊與亮源光暈；關閉後恢復普通可見與色彩。'),
('Image-intensifier night vision / NVG look','Darkness becomes a grainy green or white-phosphor monochrome image, with conspicuously sensitive bright lights (halos/bloom on lamps).','REN-30 changes exposure. PP-02 adds grain. REN-32 changes colour. None alone names the amplified-light instrument picture. Unlike NAV-08, it need not identify clues or see through walls. Green is familiar, not mandatory; white-phosphor variants belong on the same card (param: phosphor palette).','Stealth, military, sci-fi goggle views.','Switch night vision on in a dim room → scene view → reveal low-light structure in phosphor monochrome with restrained sensor noise and bright-source halos → restore ordinary visibility and colour on switch-off.'),
('暗視ゴーグル／微光暗視','闇が粒のある緑または白リンのモノクロになり、灯りは特に敏感でハロー／ブルームを帯びる。','露出（REN-30）・グレイン（PP-02）・色（REN-32）の単独ではない。NAV-08 のように手がかりや壁透視は不要。緑は定番だが必須ではなく、白リンも同カード（phosphor palette）。','ステルス、軍事、SF ゴーグル視点。','暗い部屋で NVG を入れ、リン光モノクロで低光構造を見せ、控えめノイズと光源ハローを付ける。切ると通常の可視と色に戻す。'),
'phosphor palette (green / white) · gain · noise · bloom on lights · HUD readability (authoring defaults)',
'Luminance → phosphor tint (green or white-hot grey), add mild grain, bloom bright practicals. Optionally lift near-black gain. Keep readable HUD outside or lightly treated.',
['REN-30', 'PP-02', 'REN-32', 'NAV-08', 'PP-19'],['gx_nvg', 'pp_w_grain'])

E('PP-19','風格濾鏡','Thermal vision / Thermographic imaging',['Thermal vision','FLIR-style','White-hot','Black-hot','Thermographic','熱成像','熱能視覺','白熱／黑熱','熱画像','サーモグラフィ','ホワイトホット'],'S',
('熱成像／熱能視覺','身體與剛加熱的物件依「熱」突出，可用白熱、黑熱或偽色熱力色盤。','REN-32 依影調重新上色；NAV-08 標語義線索；MATX-10 顯示被遮擋剪影。熱成像的可見層級來自溫度——不是可見亮度、敵我身分或自動穿牆。驗收必須包含「看起來暗但很熱」的物件（如黑壺或剛開火的槍管），否則亮度漸層會冒充熱成像。','潛行掃描、科幻感應、搜救。','啟用熱視：把冷環境與暖身體／槍管映射到溫度色盤；讓熱物件可見地降溫；關閉後恢復普通視圖。'),
('Thermal vision / Thermographic imaging','Bodies and recently heated objects stand out according to *heat*, in white-hot, black-hot, or a false-colour thermal palette.','REN-32 recolours by tone. NAV-08 marks semantic clues. MATX-10 shows occluded silhouettes. Thermal presentation derives hierarchy from heat — not visible brightness, enemy identity, or automatic wall penetration. Acceptance must include a visibly dark but hot object (e.g. a black kettle or just-fired barrel); otherwise a luminance gradient can masquerade as thermal vision.','Stealth scans, sci-fi sensors, search and rescue.','Enable thermal view → visible scene surfaces → map cool surroundings and warm bodies/barrels to a temperature palette; let a hot object cool visibly → return to normal view on disable.'),
('熱画像／サーモグラフィ','体と熱を持った物が「熱」に応じて目立ち、ホワイトホット／ブラックホット／偽色パレットで示される。','REN-32 の階調再着色でも、NAV-08 の手がかりでも、MATX-10 の遮蔽シルエットでもない。見える階層は温度から来る。見た目は暗いが熱い物（黒いやかん等）を必ず含め、輝度グラデの偽装を防ぐ。','ステルス走査、SF センサ、捜索。','熱視を有効にし、冷たい周囲と暖かい体／銃身を温度パレットへ。熱い物は見えるように冷める。無効化で通常へ。'),
'palette (white-hot / black-hot / ironbow) · body heat · prop heat · cool rate · wall penetration off by default (authoring defaults)',
'Author a heat buffer (not copy of luminance): warm bodies/barrels high, cold lights low even if optically bright. Remap heat through a thermal LUT. Animate cooling. Do not auto-see through walls unless a separate gameplay rule says so.',
['REN-32', 'NAV-08', 'MATX-10', 'PP-18'],['gx_thermal', 'gx_nvg'])

E('PP-20','風格濾鏡','False-colour infrared / Aerochrome',['False-colour infrared','Aerochrome','IR false colour','Wood effect','偽色紅外攝影','紅外假色','紅葉紅外效果','赤外線カラー写真','疑似カラー赤外線','エアロクローム'],'S',
('偽色紅外／Aerochrome','熟悉的風景變得陌生：植被轉鮮紅或粉紅，天空異常偏暗或強對比。這是近紅外反射，不是熱成像（PP-19）。同卡可含經典白葉「Wood effect」黑白紅外變體，勿拆成多張近乎相同的卡。','REN-32 是一般調色；PIX-06 交換色盤色。本條是依材質的光譜畫面，不是全局粉紅染色。','異世界風景、航拍感、超現實旅行。','啟用紅外風景：葉叢顯著變紅／粉（或 Wood effect 下變白），並與同樣綠色的「油漆物件」反應不同；關閉後恢復可見光外觀。'),
('False-colour infrared / Aerochrome','Familiar landscapes become alien: vegetation turns crimson or pink against unusually dark or strongly contrasting skies. This is reflected near-infrared, not the heat view (PP-19). Include classic white-foliage “Wood effect” as a related infrared variant on the same card.','REN-32 is general grading. PIX-06 swaps palette colours. This names a recognizable material-dependent spectral picture, not simply a global pink tint.','Alien landscapes, aerial looks, surreal travel.','Enable infrared landscape treatment → foliage, sky and other surfaces → make foliage conspicuously red/pink (or white in Wood-effect mode) while keeping its response distinct from similarly green *painted* objects → restore visible-light appearance on disable.'),
('偽色赤外／エアロクローム','見慣れた風景が異質になる。植生は深紅やピンク、空は異常に暗いか強いコントラスト。熱画像（PP-19）ではなく近赤外の反射。白葉の Wood effect は同カードの関連変種。','REN-32 の一般グレーディングや PIX-06 のパレット入替ではない。材質依存の分光の絵であり、全体のピンク染めではない。','異世界風景、航空感、超現実の旅。','赤外風景を有効にし、葉を赤／ピンク（Wood effect なら白）にし、同系の緑の塗装物とは違う反応にする。無効化で可視光へ。'),
'mode (Aerochrome / Wood B&W IR) · foliage map · sky darkening · painted-prop exclusion (authoring defaults)',
'Tag living foliage vs painted props. In Aerochrome mode remap foliage toward magenta/red and darken sky; painted green stays closer to visible green. Wood-effect mode: foliage → near-white, sky dark. Never a global pink multiply alone.',
['REN-32', 'PIX-06', 'PP-19'],['gx_aerochrome', 'gx_kolari'])

E('PP-21','鏡頭模擬','Gate weave / Film weave',['Gate weave','Film weave','Registration weave','菲林畫格微晃','膠片套準晃動','ゲートウィーブ','フィルムの揺れ','画揺れ'],'C',
('菲林畫格微晃／Gate weave','放映菲林影像在固定畫框內輕微遊移；整幅畫面如平面漂移，沒有攝影機視差。','PP-02 改細緻質感（顆粒）；CAM-33 移動視點（呼吸／手持）；PP-12 數碼訊號損壞；CAM-30／FB-07 因事件震動相機或螢幕。Gate weave 動的是套準，不是虛擬相機。','檔案感過場、仿底片放映、回憶包裝的一部分。','開始檔案菲林表現：固定邊框內的畫面引入克制的不規則套準漂移，邊框與 HUD 不動；關閉後穩定完美套準。'),
('Gate weave / Film weave','A projected-film image subtly wanders inside an otherwise stationary frame. The recorded picture drifts as a flat plane, without camera parallax.','PP-02 changes fine texture (grain). CAM-33 moves a viewpoint (breathing / handheld). PP-12 corrupts a digital signal. CAM-30 / FB-07 shake the camera or screen from events. Gate weave moves registration, not the virtual camera.','Archival cutaways, projected-film emulation, part of a memory package.','Start archival-film presentation → picture inside a fixed border → introduce restrained irregular registration drift while the border and HUD remain still → settle to perfect registration when disabled.'),
('ゲートウィーブ／フィルムの揺れ','映写されたフィルム映像が固定枠の中でごく小さくさまよう。絵が平面としてずれ、カメラ視差はない。','グレイン（PP-02）でも視点の呼吸（CAM-33）でもグリッチ（PP-12）でもイベント揺れ（CAM-30／FB-07）でもない。動くのはレジストレーション。','アーカイブ挿入、フィルム映写風、回想パッケージの一部。','アーカイブフィルム表現を始め、固定枠内の絵に控えめな不規則なレジストずれを入れ、枠と HUD は静止。無効化で完璧な合わせに戻す。'),
'amplitude (low) · irregularity · border/HUD lock · blend with grain (authoring defaults)',
'Offset the colour buffer by a tiny 2D noise/wander each frame inside a fixed letterbox; do not move the gameplay camera. Keep HUD and frame matte untranslated.',
['PP-02', 'CIN-14', 'CAM-33', 'CAM-30'],['gx_gateweave', 'pp_w_grain'])

E('NPR-15','筆觸與印刷','Sumi-e / ink-wash',['Sumi-e','Ink-wash','Japanese ink painting','水墨渲染','水墨畫風','水墨画','墨絵','すみえ'],'S',
('水墨／墨繪','近乎單色的世界由墨值構成：粗細不一的筆觸、可控暈染、留白，遠景溶入紙色；邊緣可有飛白。','不是水彩（NPR-07，濕潤多色暈與顆粒）；也不是排線明暗（NPR-05）；也不是石墨鉛筆（NPR-09）；也不是 1-bit 抖色（NPR-10）。','水墨標題、回憶段落、東方風格過場。','啟用水墨表現：以墨階、變化筆觸、留白與遠景淡入紙色描繪形體；場景殘色應極少或墨染；關閉後恢復普通渲染。'),
('Sumi-e / ink-wash','A monochrome (or near-monochrome) world built from ink values: bold and hair-thin strokes, controlled wash, reserved paper-white, and distant forms that dissolve into the paper colour. Dry-brush texture may appear on edges.','Not watercolor (NPR-07). Not hatching (NPR-05). Not graphite pencil (NPR-09). Not 1-bit dither (NPR-10).','Ink title cards, memory beats, East-Asian stylized cutaways.','Enable ink-wash presentation → scene forms → render with ink-step values, varied stroke weight, reserved paper-white, and receding washes that fade into paper; colour remaining in the scene should be minimal or ink-tinted → restore the ordinary rendering on disable.'),
('水墨画／墨絵','ほぼ単色の世界を墨の値で作る。太い線と髪の細い線、制御されたにじみ、余白、遠景は紙色へ溶ける。縁に飛白が出ることも。','水彩（NPR-07）でもハッチング（NPR-05）でも鉛筆（NPR-09）でも 1bit ディザ（NPR-10）でもない。','水墨タイトル、回想、東洋風の挿入。','水墨表現を有効にし、墨階・筆の太さ・余白・遠景の紙への溶けで描く。残色は最小か墨染め。無効化で通常へ。'),
'ink levels · stroke weight range · wash softness · paper colour · reserved white amount (authoring defaults)',
'Posterize to a few ink values on warm paper, emphasize silhouettes with variable-width strokes, fade distant layers toward paper, keep large empty regions. Avoid polychrome wet bleed (that is NPR-07).',
['NPR-07', 'NPR-05', 'NPR-09', 'NPR-10'],['gx_sumie', 'np_w_npr'])

E('NPR-16','筆觸與印刷','Ukiyo-e / woodblock print',['Ukiyo-e','Woodblock print','Nishiki-e','浮世繪','木刻版畫','浮世絵','木版画','錦絵'],'S',
('浮世繪／木版','平坦色塊由主版墨線圍住，天空或水面可有暈し漸層，可有輕微套色錯版；明暗不讀成 3D 賽璐璐色帶。','不是賽璐璐／色階明暗（REN-03）；也不是網點（NPR-08）；也不是線條沸騰（NPR-04）。淡淡錯版是印刷風味，不是故障（PP-12）。','和風標題、版畫過場、江戶美學。','啟用木版表現：壓平為有界色塊＋主線，天空／水面允許暈し，可選一版偏移 1px；關閉後恢復普通明暗。'),
('Ukiyo-e / woodblock print','Flat colour fields bounded by a key-block ink line, with bokashi gradients in skies or water, and optional slight plate misregistration. Lighting does not read as cel ramp bands on a 3D form.','Not cel/ramp shading (REN-03). Not halftone (NPR-08). Not line boil (NPR-04). A faint misregister is print flavour, not a glitch (PP-12).','Japanese title cards, print-style cutaways, Edo aesthetics.','Enable woodblock presentation → scene → flatten into bounded colour fields plus a key line, allow bokashi in sky/water, and optionally offset one plate by 1 px → restore ordinary shading on disable.'),
('浮世絵／木版画','平坦な色面を主版の墨線で囲み、空や水面にぼかし、わずかな版ズレを付けてもよい。3D トゥーンのバンドには見えない。','セル／ランプ（REN-03）でも網点（NPR-08）でも線沸き（NPR-04）でもない。淡いズレは印刷の味でグリッチ（PP-12）ではない。','和風タイトル、版画の挿入、江戸美学。','木版表現を有効にし、有界色面＋主線に平坦化し、空／水にぼかし、任意で 1px 版ズレ。無効化で通常陰影へ。'),
'key-line weight · flat palette · bokashi regions · plate offset px · (authoring defaults)',
'Quantize colours into flat regions, draw a dark key line on silhouettes, soft-gradient (bokashi) sky/water bands, optionally shift one colour plate by 1 px. Avoid Lambertian band ramps.',
['REN-03', 'NPR-08', 'REN-04', 'NPR-04', 'NPR-18'],['gx_ukiyoe', 'np_w_npr'])

E('NPR-17','筆觸與印刷','Stroke-based impasto',['Impasto','Brush-stroke shading','Painted relief strokes','厚塗筆觸','浮雕筆觸','インパスト','厚塗り筆触'],'S',
('厚塗筆觸／浮雕筆觸','可見的筆觸沿形體走，並有輕微浮雕／高光，像厚顏料坐在表面上。','不是 Kuwahara／畫面濾波器（NPR-06，聚類螢幕顏色而無作者筆向）；也不是水彩暈（NPR-07）；也不是排線（NPR-05）。','油畫特寫、畫廊風格、需要「筆有方向」的繪本感。','啟用厚塗：實體形以沿形的離散筆觸取代光滑明暗，脊上帶一點高光；關閉後恢復光滑明暗。'),
('Stroke-based impasto','Visible paint strokes that follow the form, with a slight relief / catch-light as if thick paint sits on the surface.','Not a Kuwahara / painterly *filter* (NPR-06) that clusters screen colours without authored stroke direction. Not wash (NPR-07). Not hatched lines (NPR-05).','Oil close-ups, gallery looks, storybook strokes with direction.','Enable impasto presentation → solid forms → replace smooth shading with discrete, form-following strokes that catch a little highlight on their ridges → restore smooth shading on disable.'),
('インパスト／厚塗り筆触','形に沿う見える筆触と、厚い絵具のようなわずかな浮きとハイライト。','桑原などの画面フィルタ（NPR-06）でも水彩（NPR-07）でもハッチング（NPR-05）でもない。','油画の寄り、画廊風、方向のある筆。','厚塗りを有効にし、滑らかな陰影を形に沿う離散筆触に置き、稜にハイライト。無効化で滑らかへ。'),
'stroke length/width · direction from normals · relief highlight · blend (authoring defaults)',
'Generate oriented stroke quads/decals from surface normals or flow maps; shade each stroke with a slight specular ridge. Distinct from neighbourhood-averaging painterly filters.',
['NPR-06', 'NPR-07', 'NPR-05'],['gx_impasto', 'np_w_kuwa'])

E('NPR-18','筆觸與印刷','Risograph / misregistered spot-colour print',['Risograph','Riso print','Spot-colour overlay','Stencil print misregistration','孔版錯版套印','Risograph 風格','リソグラフ','孔版印刷','版ズレ'],'S',
('孔版／Risograph 錯版套印','少數專色層（常螢光粉、藍、黃）疊印，帶可見紋理與輕微錯版，呈現有限油墨而非連續 RGB。','不是作為明暗圖案的網點（NPR-08——雖 riso 常用粗網點，本條命名分層印刷物）；也不是像素抖色（PIX-08）；也不是數碼故障（PP-12）。交叉連到 NPR-08 並註明網角。','獨立刊物風、海報 UI、復古印刷過場。','啟用 riso：把影像分成 2–3 個專色版疊印，帶顆粒孔版紋理與 1–2px 錯版；關閉後恢復連續色彩。'),
('Risograph / misregistered spot-colour print','A few spot-colour layers (often fluorescent pink, blue, yellow) overprint with visible texture and slight misregistration, plus the look of limited inks rather than continuous RGB.','Not halftone/Ben-Day as a shading pattern (NPR-08 — though riso often uses coarse halftone; this card names the layered print object). Not pixel dither (PIX-08). Not digital corruption (PP-12). Cross-link NPR-08 and note screen angles there.','Zine aesthetics, poster UI, print cutaways.','Enable riso presentation → scene → separate the image into 2–3 spot plates that overprint, with grainy stencil texture and a 1–2 px plate offset → restore continuous colour on disable.'),
('リソグラフ／孔版の版ズレ','蛍光ピンク・青・黄など少数のスポット色が重ね刷りされ、テクスチャとわずかな版ズレ、限られたインク感が出る。','網点シェーディング（NPR-08）そのものではない（粗い網を使うことは多い）。ピクセルディザ（PIX-08）でもグリッチ（PP-12）でもない。','ジン風、ポスター UI、印刷の挿入。','リソを有効にし、2〜3 版のスポット重ね、粒状ステンシル、1〜2px ズレ。無効化で連続色へ。'),
'spot inks · overprint mode · grain · plate offset · screen angle note (authoring defaults)',
'Split the image into 2–3 ink masks (thresholded channels), tint each with a spot colour, offset plates by 1–2 px, multiply/overprint with grain. Link NPR-08 for screen-angle flavour without becoming that card.',
['NPR-08', 'PIX-08', 'NPR-16'],['gx_riso', 'np_w_halftone'])

E('NPR-19','復古與低保真','Papercraft / paper-world construction',['Papercraft','Paper theatre','Construction-paper world','Layered paper diorama','剪紙','紙藝世界','層疊色紙','ペーパークラフト','切り紙','紙の世界'],'C',
('剪紙／紙藝世界','世界讀起來像裁切、堆疊或摺疊的紙：銳利剪影、可見厚度或層平面、紙纖維、層間陰影。這是構造，不是油漆濾鏡。','不是 HD-2D（NPR-14）；也不是低多邊形切面（NPR-12）；也不是單獨的圓形假影（LGT-10）。','紙劇場標題、兒童書世界、手工感過場。','啟用紙藝：每個元素讀成裁紙層，有薄邊、微偏移陰影與紙紋；運動可如鉸鏈或滑層；關閉後恢復普通實體。'),
('Papercraft / paper-world construction','The world reads as cut, stacked, or folded paper: crisp silhouettes, visible thickness or stacked planes, paper fibre, and shadows between layers. It is a construction, not a paint filter.','Not HD-2D (NPR-14). Not faceted low-poly (NPR-12). Not a generic drop shadow alone (LGT-10).','Paper-theatre titles, children’s-book worlds, handmade cutaways.','Enable papercraft presentation → scene elements → each reads as a cut paper layer with a thin edge, slight offset shadow, and paper texture; motion can be as hinged or sliding layers → restore ordinary solids on disable.'),
('ペーパークラフト／紙の世界','切り・積み・折った紙として読める。鋭いシルエット、厚みや層、紙の目、層の影。塗りのフィルタではなく構物。','HD-2D（NPR-14）でもローポリ（NPR-12）でも丸影だけ（LGT-10）でもない。','紙芝居タイトル、絵本世界、手作りの挿入。','ペーパークラフトを有効にし、各要素を切り紙層（薄い縁・ずれ影・紙目）にする。無効化で通常の立体へ。'),
'layer count · edge thickness · inter-layer shadow · paper texture · hinge motion (authoring defaults)',
'Render elements as offset flat cards with extruded thin edges and contact shadows between layers; sample a paper-fibre texture. Animate as sliding/hinged planes rather than skinned meshes.',
['NPR-14', 'NPR-12', 'LGT-10'],['gx_papercraft'],nosrc=True)

E('NPR-20','筆觸與印刷','Stained-glass cell style',['Stained-glass shading','Leaded-glass cells','Glowing glass panes','彩繪玻璃格子風格','鑲嵌玻璃畫面','ステンドグラス風','鉛枠の彩色セル'],'S',
('彩繪玻璃格子風格','畫面本身被切成鉛框分隔的發光平坦（或柔漸層）色格。','必須與彩窗色光池（LGT-16）分開：那是色光落在其他表面上；本條是畫面（或窗物件）的風格化。也不是網點（NPR-08）；也不是無鉛線的賽璐璐色帶（REN-03）。','角色變成彩窗、玫瑰窗物件、神聖風格化。','啟用彩繪玻璃風格：形狀成為由深鉛線分隔的發光色格；關閉後恢復普通渲染。示範勿畫成地板色光池（那是 LGT-16）。'),
('Stained-glass cell style','The image itself is broken into leaded cells of glowing flat (or softly graded) colour, with dark came lines between panes.','Must stay distinct from stained-glass light pools (LGT-16), which are coloured *light falling on other surfaces*. This is a stylization of the picture (or of a window object). Not dots (NPR-08). Not cel bands without came lines (REN-03).','Characters as glass, rose-window props, sacred stylization.','Enable stained-glass style → scene or window → shapes become bounded glowing cells separated by dark lead lines → restore ordinary rendering on disable. Do not show coloured floor pools unless clearly labeled as the other effect and linked to LGT-16.'),
('ステンドグラス風／鉛枠セル','画面自体が鉛枠で区切られた光る平（または柔らかいグラデ）の色セルになる。','色光だまり（LGT-16）と必ず区別。網点（NPR-08）でも鉛線なしトゥーン（REN-03）でもない。','キャラを窓に、バラ窓、聖性の様式。','ステンド風を有効にし、形を鉛線で区切った光るセルにする。床の色光だまりは描かない（それは LGT-16）。'),
'cell size · came width · glow · palette · (authoring defaults)',
'Segment the image (or a mesh) into polygonal cells, fill with flat/soft colours, draw dark came lines, add slight emission. Keep lighting of surrounding room separate from LGT-16 pools.',
['LGT-16', 'REN-03', 'NPR-16'],['gx_stained_cells', 'gx_stained_pool'])

E('NPR-21','卡通明暗','Authored shadow colours',['Authored shadow colour','Painted shadow hue','Material-specific shade colour','手繪影色','指定陰影色','指定影色','影色の塗り分け'],'S',
('手繪影色／指定陰影色','每種材質（皮膚、布、葉、金屬）使用自己設計的陰影色——選定的色相與明度——而非全局乘向黑。','不是物理染色反彈（REN-20）；也不是像素色階色相偏移（PIX-09，雖相關）；也不是單一全畫面調色（REN-32）；也不是臉部核心暗帶形狀（NPR-22）。','動畫上色、材質可讀的 stylized 角色。','用兩三種材質打光：各材質暗側使用其指定影色（例：皮膚暖鏽、布深藍靛、葉冷綠）而非只把反照率變暗；關閉後恢復中性變暗。'),
('Authored shadow colours','Each material (skin, cloth, foliage, metal) receives its own designed shadow colour — a chosen hue and value — rather than a global multiply-toward-black.','Not physical colour bleeding (REN-20). Not pixel-art ramp hue shift (PIX-09, though related). Not a single fullscreen grade (REN-32). Not the *shape* of a face core shadow (NPR-22).','Anime paint, stylized characters with readable materials.','Light a scene with two or three materials → each material’s shaded side → use that material’s authored shadow colour (e.g. skin → warm rust, cloth → deep indigo, leaves → cool green) instead of darkened albedo alone → restore neutral darkening on disable.'),
('指定影色／影色の塗り分け','肌・布・葉・金属など材質ごとに設計した影色（色相と明度）を使い、黒への一律乗算にしない。','物理の色移り（REN-20）でもピクセルランプ（PIX-09）でも全体グレーディング（REN-32）でもコアシャドウ形状（NPR-22）でもない。','アニメ塗り、材質が読める様式キャラ。','2〜3 材質をライティングし、各暗部に指定影色（肌＝暖錆、布＝藍、葉＝冷緑など）。無効化で中立な暗さへ。'),
'per-material shadow colour · shadow value · blend vs N·L · compare multiply-black (authoring defaults)',
'In the shade lobe, lerp toward material.shadowColour instead of albedo*lightColour*N·L alone. Expose a swatch vs multiply-black compare. Cross-link NPR-22/23 for shape authorship.',
['REN-03', 'PIX-09', 'REN-20', 'REN-32', 'NPR-22', 'NPR-23'],['gx_shadow_col', 'np_w_npr'],nosrc=True)

E('NPR-22','卡通明暗','Core-shadow band',['Core shadow','Terminator band','Dark band at the terminator','明暗交界暗帶','コアシャドウ','明暗境界の暗帯'],'S',
('明暗交界暗帶／コアシャドウ','沿明暗交界有一道更窄、更深或更濃的帶，然後形影在反彈前略為打開。','不是腔體 AO（REN-21／REN-22）；也不是亮邊緣光（REN-05）；也不是 REN-03 的第二條賽璐璐帶本身（雖可寫進色階）。本條命名畫家的交界強調。','角色臉／球體、需要「交界更重」的手繪明暗。','照亮圓形體：在交界畫一道隨光移動的更深／更濃窄帶，形影其餘部分比該帶更淺；光變全包圍／純環境光時帶消失。'),
('Core-shadow band','Along the light/dark terminator a narrower, deeper or richer band appears, then the form shadow opens slightly again before the bounce.','Not cavity AO (REN-21/REN-22). Not a bright rim (REN-05). Not merely a second cel band from REN-03 (though it can be authored into a ramp). This names the painter’s terminator accent.','Faces and rounded forms with painted shading.','Light a rounded form → the terminator → draw a deeper/richer narrow band that travels with the light; the rest of the form shadow stays lighter than that band → band disappears if the light becomes fully wraparound / ambient.'),
('コアシャドウ／明暗境界の暗帯','明暗の境に、より狭く深い／濃い帯があり、そのあとフォームシャドウがバウンス前に少し開く。','キャビティ AO（REN-21／22）でもリム（REN-05）でも、ただの第二トゥーン帯そのもの（REN-03）でもない。画家の境の強調。','顔や球体、境を重くしたい手描き陰影。','丸い形を照らすと、境に光と一緒に動く濃い窄帯を描き、残りの影はその帯より浅い。完全ラップ／アンビエントでは消える。'),
'band width · band darkness · travel with light · wrap kill (authoring defaults)',
'Where N·L crosses the terminator, darken a narrow band (or author it into the ramp). Keep the remainder of the form shadow lighter. Hide the band under strong wrap/ambient-only lighting.',
['REN-03', 'REN-21', 'NPR-21', 'NPR-23'],['gx_core_shadow'],nosrc=True)

E('NPR-23','卡通明暗','Art-directed face shadows',['Authored face shadow','Painted cheek shadow','Design-shadow face','作畫式臉影','指定臉部陰影','作画的な顔影','影の設計'],'S',
('作畫式臉影','臉部陰影跟隨角色美術指定的圖形形狀（頰面、鼻下、下顎 scoop），不是解剖腔體的硬投影。','不是眼窩／鼻孔的腔體著色（REN-21）；也不是寫實法線貼圖頭。不要拆成 SDF 影、編輯法線、shade map 三張卡——那些是同一畫面的方法。日文若需影濃度別名，用 影の濃さ／陰になりやすさ／シェーディンググレード；勿用「屠り濃さ」。','動畫臉、需要穩定圖形臉影的 stylized 角色。','照亮風格化臉：頰／鼻／顎的圖形影在合理光域內轉頭時保持設計輪廓，而非爬過每道皺褶；關閉後恢復預設明暗。'),
('Art-directed face shadows','Face shading follows drawn graphic shapes (cheek plane, under-nose, jaw scoop) chosen by a character artist, not a hard cast of anatomical cavities.','Not REN-21 cavity shading of eye sockets / nostrils. Not a photoreal normal-mapped head. Do not split SDF shadows, edited normals, or shade maps into separate cards — those are methods for the same picture. For Japanese density aliases prefer 影の濃さ / 陰になりやすさ / シェーディンググレード; do not use 「屠り濃さ」.','Anime faces, stylized characters that need stable graphic shade.','Light a stylized face → cheek / nose / jaw → graphic shadow shapes hold their designed silhouette as the head turns within a reasonable light range, rather than crawling through every crease → restore default shading on disable.'),
('作画的な顔影／影の設計','頬・鼻下・顎などの作画で決めた図形の影に従い、解剖的な凹の硬い投影ではない。','眼窩などのキャビティ（REN-21）でも写実ノーマル頭でもない。SDF／編集法線／シェードマップを別カードにしない——同一の絵の手段。濃度の別名は影の濃さ／陰になりやすさ／シェーディンググレード。「屠り濃さ」は使わない。','アニメ顔、安定した図形影が欲しい様式。','様式化した顔を照らし、頬／鼻／顎の図形影が妥当な光域で輪郭を保つ。無効化で既定陰影へ。'),
'shadow mask / SDF · density · light range before crawl · cavity compare lane (authoring defaults)',
'Blend a painted shade mask / edited normals / SDF shadow into the face ramp so graphic shapes persist across a light range. Demo CAVITY vs AUTHORED lanes. Methods stay on this card.',
['REN-03', 'NPR-21', 'NPR-22', 'REN-13'],['gx_face_shadow', 'np_w_npr'],nosrc=True)

E('NPR-24','卡通明暗','Cavity and ridge shading',['Cavity shading','Concavity darkening','Ridge highlight','Curvature shading','凹槽暗染','凸脊提亮','キャビティシェーディング','凹みを落とす','エッジの強調'],'S',
('凹槽暗染／凸脊提亮','凹處額外變暗、凸脊略提亮，使雕刻細節在平光下仍可讀。','不是一般大尺度 AO／SSAO（REN-21／REN-22——相關，但本條命名更緊的曲率／凹凸強調，作 stylized 或雕塑通道）；也不是描邊（REN-04）；也不是寬闊形體的核心暗帶（NPR-22）。','盔甲溝槽、石雕、需要平光可讀細節的道具。','在均勻光下展示雕塑表面：凹處依曲率變暗、脊提亮；若光變極強方向光，強調可減弱（或作為作者疊加保留——擇一並寫明）。'),
('Cavity and ridge shading','Concave crevices receive extra darkening and convex ridges a slight lift, making carved detail readable even under flat light.','Not general AO / SSAO of large occluded pockets (REN-21 / REN-22 — related, but this names the tighter curvature/cavity-ridge accent). Not an outline (REN-04). Not a terminator core shadow on a broad form (NPR-22).','Armor grooves, carved stone, props that must read under flat light.','Show a sculpted surface under even light → concavities darken and ridges lift according to local curvature → the accent eases if the light becomes extremely harsh and directional (document if kept as an authored overlay).'),
('キャビティ／リッジシェーディング','凹は余分に落ち、凸稜はわずかに持ち上がり、平光でも彫刻ディテールが読める。','大きな AO／SSAO（REN-21／22）そのものではない。輪郭（REN-04）でもコアシャドウ（NPR-22）でもない。','鎧の溝、石彫、平光で読みたい小物。','均一光の彫刻面で、曲率に応じて凹を落とし稜を上げる。強い方向光では弱めてよい（または作画オーバーレイとして残す——どちらかを明記）。'),
'cavity amount · ridge amount · curvature scale · AO compare · harsh-light falloff (authoring defaults)',
'Use baked curvature/cavity maps or screen-space curvature to darken concavities and lift ridges as a stylized pass under flat light. Provide AO-only vs CAVITY+RIDGE compare.',
['REN-21', 'REN-22', 'REN-04', 'NPR-22'],['gx_cavity', 'lg_ue_contact'],nosrc=True)
